# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup {#setup}"
msgstr "Penyiapan {#setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following helper functions are used by the large-scale hardware example later in the tutorial:\n"
msgstr "Fungsi helper berikut dipakai oleh contoh hardware skala besar di bagian akhir tutorial:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`bad_cz`, `bad_readout`, `bad_coherence` — Query the backend calibration data to identify gates, qubits, and edges that exceed error or coherence thresholds, so they can be excluded from the circuit layout.\n"
msgstr "`bad_cz`, `bad_readout`, `bad_coherence` — Mengquery data kalibrasi backend untuk mengidentifikasi gate, qubit, dan edge yang melebihi ambang error atau koherensi, sehingga bisa dikecualikan dari layout circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`parallel_ghz` — Builds a GHZ circuit of a given size using a breadth-first search over the coupling map, spreading CNOT layers in parallel to minimize circuit depth.\n"
msgstr "`parallel_ghz` — Membangun circuit GHZ dengan ukuran tertentu memakai breadth-first search pada coupling map, menyebar layer CNOT secara paralel untuk meminimalkan kedalaman circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`weighted_coverage`, `active_wires`, `z_trace_backward` — Compute how much of the GHZ circuit's error surface is protected by a given set of spacetime parity checks, using the backward-propagation technique from [[6]](#references).\n"
msgstr "`weighted_coverage`, `active_wires`, `z_trace_backward` — Menghitung seberapa besar permukaan error circuit GHZ yang dilindungi oleh sekumpulan pemeriksaan paritas spacetime tertentu, memakai teknik propagasi mundur dari [[6]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`add_measurements` — Appends GHZ-qubit and check-qubit measurements into separate classical registers so they can be postselected independently.\n"
msgstr "`add_measurements` — Menambahkan pengukuran qubit GHZ dan qubit pemeriksaan ke register klasik terpisah sehingga bisa dipostseleksi secara independen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`build_shadow_circuits` — Produces one circuit per random Pauli basis by appending the appropriate single-qubit rotations before measurement.\n"
msgstr "`build_shadow_circuits` — Menghasilkan satu circuit per basis Pauli acak dengan menambahkan rotasi satu qubit yang sesuai sebelum pengukuran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`parse_hw_results_w_checks` — Unpacks the Sampler output into `(ghz_bits, check_bits, bases)` triples, one per shot.\n"
msgstr "`parse_hw_results_w_checks` — Membongkar output Sampler menjadi triplet `(ghz_bits, check_bits, bases)`, satu per shot.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`adapt_to_flat_bits`, `estimate_zz_nn_hw` — Map the GHZ-register bits back into the full-device index space and compute the median-of-means $\\langle Z_i Z_{i+1}\\rangle$ estimate.\n"
msgstr "`adapt_to_flat_bits`, `estimate_zz_nn_hw` — Memetakan bit register GHZ kembali ke ruang indeks perangkat penuh dan menghitung estimasi median-of-means $\\langle Z_i Z_{i+1}\\rangle$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Small-scale simulator example {#small-scale-simulator-example}"
msgstr "Contoh simulator skala kecil {#small-scale-simulator-example}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, prepare a 10-qubit GHZ state using statevector simulation and estimate its properties using local Pauli shadows. The GHZ state is a maximally entangled quantum state with three or more qubits serving as a benchmark for multipartite entanglement. It is a common building block for quantum communication and cryptography protocols. Additionally, the GHZ circuit has fully known analytical properties, making it ideal for verification in this tutorial.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, siapkan state GHZ 10 qubit memakai simulasi statevector dan estimasi propertinya memakai shadow Pauli lokal. State GHZ adalah state kuantum yang maksimal entangled dengan tiga qubit atau lebih, yang menjadi tolok ukur untuk entanglement multipartit. State ini merupakan blok bangunan umum untuk protokol komunikasi kuantum dan kriptografi. Selain itu, circuit GHZ punya properti analitik yang diketahui sepenuhnya, sehingga ideal untuk verifikasi dalam tutorial ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik ke masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare an ideal 10-qubit GHZ state.\n"
msgstr "Siapkan state GHZ 10 qubit yang ideal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimalkan untuk eksekusi di hardware kuantum {#step-2-optimize-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, define a function that collects shadow snapshots by rotating the GHZ state into random Pauli bases. This mirrors what the Sampler primitive does on hardware in the large-scale example.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, definisikan fungsi yang mengumpulkan snapshot shadow dengan merotasi state GHZ ke basis Pauli acak. Ini meniru apa yang dilakukan primitif Sampler pada hardware dalam contoh skala besar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Eksekusi memakai primitif Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this simulation, use the statevector directly.\n"
msgstr "Untuk simulasi ini, pakai statevector secara langsung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pasca-proses dan kembalikan hasil dalam format klasik yang diinginkan {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the shadow estimator and the median-of-means (MOM) estimator for the random measurement bases used to collect the shadow snapshots. Use these functions to estimate properties of the GHZ state, including single-qubit magnetization, two-qubit correlators, and the two-qubit RDM, from the collected measurements. Then compare the estimates with the exact values.\n"
msgstr "Definisikan shadow estimator dan median-of-means (MOM) estimator untuk basis pengukuran acak yang dipakai buat mengumpulkan snapshot shadow. Pakai fungsi-fungsi ini untuk memperkirakan properti state GHZ, termasuk magnetisasi satu qubit, korelator dua qubit, dan RDM dua qubit, dari hasil pengukuran yang terkumpul. Lalu bandingkan estimasinya dengan nilai eksak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the results {#visualize-the-results}"
msgstr "Visualisasikan hasilnya {#visualize-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first plot shows the estimated single-qubit magnetization values for the different qubits. The second plot shows the distribution of estimated two-point correlator values for all qubit pairs. The final plot shows the magnitude of the two-qubit reduced density matrix entries. A fairly large collection of snapshots is used for the given system size, so the results are close to the exact ones.\n"
msgstr "Plot pertama menunjukkan nilai magnetisasi single-qubit hasil estimasi untuk tiap qubit. Plot kedua menunjukkan distribusi nilai korelator dua titik hasil estimasi untuk semua pasangan qubit. Plot terakhir menunjukkan besaran entri matriks densitas tereduksi dua-qubit. Jumlah snapshot yang dipakai cukup besar untuk ukuran sistem ini, jadi hasilnya dekat dengan nilai eksak.\n"

